{"id":"n65329-2-7","stage":4,"title":"스러지다 · 熄灭","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n65329-2-7-1","ko":"불이 스러져서 점점 추워지네.","zh":"火快熄灭了，越来越冷了呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"불이","meaning":"火","explanation":"불：火；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"불","audio":"/audio/05e6efdf147502fc3ac3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61154","senseId":"2","lemma":"불","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"불이","audio":"/audio/9312b03715e82a6ac161.mp3"}},{"text":"스러져서","meaning":"熄灭","explanation":"스러지다：熄灭；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"스러지다","audio":"/audio/038cd701a6319fd34c4f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65329","senseId":"2","lemma":"스러지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"스러져서","audio":"/audio/548fe8d55fd870434452.mp3"}},{"text":"점점","meaning":"越来越","explanation":"점점：越来越","readings":[{"term":"점점","audio":"/audio/2de57161655ba687e8ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70871","senseId":"1","lemma":"점점","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"점점","audio":"/audio/2de57161655ba687e8ee.mp3"}},{"text":"추워지네.","meaning":"冷；表示成为前面表达的状态。","explanation":"춥다：冷；지다：表示成为前面表达的状态。；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"춥다","audio":"/audio/7c651efb56d12a6540a4.mp3"},{"term":"지다","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72146","senseId":"1","lemma":"춥다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77247","senseId":"3","lemma":"지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"추워지네","audio":"/audio/82458a64b26679fc706e.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"05e6efdf147502fc","term":"불","zh":"火","audio":"/audio/05e6efdf147502fc3ac3.mp3","entryId":"61154","definition":"发出光亮、照亮黑暗的物体。","pronunciation":["불"]},{"id":"038cd701a6319fd3","term":"스러지다","zh":"熄灭","audio":"/audio/038cd701a6319fd34c4f.mp3","entryId":"65329","definition":"火变弱熄灭。","pronunciation":["스러지다"]},{"id":"2de57161655ba687","term":"점점","zh":"越来越","audio":"/audio/2de57161655ba687e8ee.mp3","entryId":"70871","definition":"程度随着时间的推移而逐渐地。","pronunciation":["점ː점"]},{"id":"7c651efb56d12a65","term":"춥다","zh":"冷","audio":"/audio/7c651efb56d12a6540a4.mp3","entryId":"72146","definition":"身体感觉到的气温低。","pronunciation":["춥따"]},{"id":"6fde84679c7f2c31","term":"지다","zh":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3","entryId":"77247","definition":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","pronunciation":["지다"]}],"audio":"/audio/392cbf2550f32c850531.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n65329-2-7-2","ko":"내가 더 태울 것이 있는지 찾아볼게.","zh":"我这就去看看还有没有可以再添的柴火。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"내가","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내가","audio":"/audio/7ee3e480d2ca3192b2bc.mp3"}},{"text":"더","meaning":"更，更加","explanation":"더：更，更加","readings":[{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26829","senseId":"2","lemma":"더","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}},{"text":"태울","meaning":"点燃","explanation":"태우다：点燃；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"태우다","audio":"/audio/edf8a40f04fcd93a7a57.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60172","senseId":"1","lemma":"태우다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"태울","audio":"/audio/b618fadd8385f599a232.mp3"}},{"text":"것이","meaning":"东西，事，的","explanation":"것：东西，事，的；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"1","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것이","audio":"/audio/466d343bd03b56aac534.mp3"}},{"text":"있는지","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；는지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"있다","a